BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:All My Heart This Night Rejoices: The Old World Carolers in Concer
 t
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T150000
UID:15ec031d81fa06a8fda324e0dd980849@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Since 1985\, Sebastopol’s Old World Carolers has sung for pe
 ace and justice\, green energy\, human rights\, animal shelters\, homeless
  shelters\, shut-ins\, guide dogs\, and many other benefits for the planet
  and the community\, the main benefit being the preservation of rare and b
 eautiful songs in people's homes and lives. We present these songs and car
 ols in a simple way so they can be taken home by listeners and sung around
  the house\, becoming a part of family traditions. History is an important
  part of what we do: learning about cultures through their languages\, tra
 ditions\, and songs. This year the program includes carols from England\, 
 Wales\, France\, Germany\, Spain\, and Denmark. The public is always invit
 ed to sing along\, and song sheets are provided for the entire concert. Th
 e second part of the concert includes well-known standards for singing alo
 ng. This is our 41st year of singing for good causes in Sebastopol. By don
 ating at our concert or purchasing one of our CDs\, listeners can parti
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/all-my-heart-this-night
 -rejoices-the-old-world-carolers-in-concert
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Infant CPR and Safety Class for Parents
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261215T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261215T203000
UID:53815e9a5541e38d8397e651aefe0126@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you a new or expecting parent wanting to learn how to resp
 ond if your baby experiences a cardiac\, respiratory\, choking\, or other 
 medical emergency? We've got you covered! This class is perfect for anyone
  who will be around babies and infants\, including babysitters and family 
 members. Our Infant CPR for Parents class covers CPR\, first aid\, choking
  treatment\, and much more\, for newborn babies and infants (up to 1 year 
 old). Since breathing problems and preventable injuries are among the lead
 ing causes of infant mortality\, this class addresses safety and preventio
 n measures that can be taken to avoid such incidents. We also cover what d
 o if an emergency happens\, including who to call\, where to go\, and what
  you can do while you’re waiting for paramedics. Learn from a top-rated\
 , local CPR training company with over 1\,000 5-star reviews! Our classes 
 are fun\, engaging\, and expertly taught by professional first responders.
  Intended Audience: New parents\, expecting parents\, their family mem
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/infant-cpr-and-safety-c
 lass-for-parents-12-15-2026
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Infant CPR and Safety Class for Parents
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270118T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270118T203000
UID:04b09e95b5cf1bfd47a2262f979102af@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you a new or expecting parent who wants to know how to res
 pond if your baby experiences a cardiac\, breathing\, choking\, or other m
 edical emergency? This class is designed for parents and anyone who cares 
 for or spends time around infants. Our Infant CPR for Parents class covers
  CPR\, first aid\, choking treatment\, injury prevention\, and emergency r
 esponse for newborns and infants up to 1 year old. You’ll learn how to r
 educe common safety risks\, what to do in an emergency\, who to call\, whe
 re to go\, and how to help while waiting for paramedics. Learn from a top-
 rated\, local CPR training company with over 1\,000 5-star reviews! Our cl
 asses are fun\, engaging\, and expertly taught by professional first respo
 nders. Ideal for new and expecting parents\, family members\, friends\, ba
 bysitters\, nannies\, caregivers\, teachers\, employees\, personal assista
 nts\, and others who want to confidently respond to infant emergencies. Le
 arn More & Enroll: https://vivecpr.com/class/infant-cpr-for-parents/
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/infant-cpr-and-safety-c
 lass-for-parents-01-18-2027
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
